{
  "about": "CC-fancy-0050: the active sheet on read and write, and the `formulas` write option. Read by all three ports; every expectation is written by hand. Options are PHP's: read(bytes, {sheet}) and toBytes(schema, {formulas}). `activeSheet: null` means the key is absent. `bookViews: null` means workbook.xml has no <bookViews>.",
